{"2428450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "South Words Hero", "steam_appid": 2428450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When reality itself is threatened, the chosen hero begins a journey. What is that hero's name? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Names are power:</strong> Everyone in the world can namesummon, which means ripping letters out of your name and using them as weapons, shields, and tools. Each letter has a different function. With 26 possible abilities, there are practically endless combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weaponized Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter many monsters and foes during your quest. Each can be defeated in a variety of ways, so be creative in how you use your name.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/c12946a562b85160aba6feb6c3d69ba6.poster.avif?t=1758666681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/c12946a562b85160aba6feb6c3d69ba6.webm?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/c12946a562b85160aba6feb6c3d69ba6.mp4?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Typographical Tricks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Names have utility beyond combat. Solve puzzles and navigate past obstacles. No matter which name you pick, there is always a way to move forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/1b803b12d4164e3c1e86fb4a5ca05d06.poster.avif?t=1758666681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/1b803b12d4164e3c1e86fb4a5ca05d06.webm?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/1b803b12d4164e3c1e86fb4a5ca05d06.mp4?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Weird World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and befriend eccentric characters. Make impactful choices, and see the different directions this story can take. The world changes in subtle ways depending on your name, so play again and see if you can spot the differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/6393be56588a68c6f1c2925ae1ae0f26.poster.avif?t=1758666681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/6393be56588a68c6f1c2925ae1ae0f26.webm?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/6393be56588a68c6f1c2925ae1ae0f26.mp4?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When reality itself is threatened, the chosen hero begins a journey. What is that hero's name? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Names are power:</strong> Everyone in the world can namesummon, which means ripping letters out of your name and using them as weapons, shields, and tools. Each letter has a different function. With 26 possible abilities, there are practically endless combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weaponized Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter many monsters and foes during your quest. Each can be defeated in a variety of ways, so be creative in how you use your name.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 