be56588a68c6f1c2925ae1ae0f26.poster.avif?t=1758666681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/6393be56588a68c6f1c2925ae1ae0f26.webm?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/6393be56588a68c6f1c2925ae1ae0f26.mp4?t=1758666681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Journey through a world where names are power. Rip letters from your name and use them to battle foes, solve puzzles, and uncover secrets. Different names open different paths, so every adventure is unique.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/header.jpg?t=1758666681", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/f50de8c037044e042d1bead8e0ea5d3763348af8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758666681", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/f50de8c037044e042d1bead8e0ea5d3763348af8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758666681", "website": "https://www.tykenn.games/south-words-hero/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ty Kennington"], "publishers": ["Ty Kennington"], "demos": [{"appid": 3841490, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akam